# The read in read() watches what stands above `top`. When `middle` arrives there the read is told by that node, and a read told by a node that it watches laid no watch: what stands above `middle`, still empty then, was never watched, and `base` came to nobody. The watch on what stands above is laid in that telling too, once a node.
